Copyright 2025 The Paper Mono Project Authors (https://github.com/paper-design/paper-mono)

This file is a subset of paper_mono, made by "modustool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126, the characters U+00A0 to U+00FF, the characters U+20AC,
the characters that each process draws from the outlines, U+039B to U+039B U+03A9 to U+03A9 U+03BB to U+03BC U+03C0 to U+03C0 U+2500 to U+257F U+2580 to U+259F,
and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(66 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables;
the character 0 is the glyph 304 of the source, the slashed zero of its
feature zero. The subset carries the name "Paper Mono ASCII".
License of the source: SIL OFL 1.1, no Reserved Font Name.

The text of the license in the source font file:

